/// environment (CI compiles the AOT bundle ONCE per run — the
/// `fa-aot-build` job — and exports it for the whole test step), else the
/// JIT [jitPrefix] + [args].
///
/// Why the seam exists: every PTY/CLI integration test spawns a fresh
